{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30000","headline":"监试夜雨滴空堦 · 喻凫","name":"监试夜雨滴空堦","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霎霎复凄凄，飘松又洒槐。\n气蒙蛛网槛，声叠藓花堦。\n古壁青灯动，深庭湿叶埋。\n徐垂旧夗瓦，竞历小茅斋。\n冷与阴虫间，清将玉漏谐。\n病身唯展转，谁见此时怀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"喻凫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30000.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30000","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}